      "H5-adservice-latency-degradation": "if propagation from adservice to frontend is consistent, supports H5 root cause; if missing or inconsistent, contradicts H5.",
      "H3-currencyservice-latency-degradation": "if propagation found, further weakens H3; if no path, does not directly support H3 but weakens H5."
